# Build context exclusions. Applies to the Dockerfile built from this
# repo root (deploy/Dockerfile).
#
# Kept OUT: VCS metadata, secrets, local state, docs — none of it is needed
# to compile the binary, and .env* must never ride along in a build
# context (a local .env holds real provider keys).
#
# Kept IN on purpose:
# - config.yaml — copied into the gateway image by the final stage.
.git
.github
.env*
*.db
.jules
.jspace
docs/
deploy/
*.md
